category: Utils
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Display directories as trees (with optional color/HTML output)"
ldesc: "Tree is a recursive directory listing command that produces a depth indented
listing of files, which is colorized ala dircolors if the LS_COLORS
environment variable is set and output is to tty."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/Old-Man-Programmer/tree
